{"id":"e733fe56d69651f6","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-zfc-recursion2-truth-table-reducibility.md","title":"ZFC Recursion2 Truth Table Reducibility","display":"df-zfc-recursion2-truth-table-reducibility — ZFC Recursion2 Truth Table Reducibility","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-recursion2-truth-table-reducibility","aliases":["58-df-zfc-recursion2-truth-table-reducibility"],"display":"df-zfc-recursion2-truth-table-reducibility — ZFC Recursion2 Truth Table Reducibility","depends_on":["[[../batch06/58-df-zfc-recursion2-total-computable-map.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-recursion2-truth-table-reducibility"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-recursion2-truth-table-reducibility</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-recursion2-truth-table-reducibility — ZFC Recursion2 Truth Table Reducibility"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"afc30501f405cff5\" href=\"?note=afc30501f405cff5\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-zfc-recursion2-total-computable-map.md\">../batch06/58-df-zfc-recursion2-total-computable-map.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B,k,q,b,\\pi,c,m,v,r,n\\in V\">\\(A,B,k,q,b,\\pi,c,m,v,r,n\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2TotalComputableMap}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2TotalComputableMap}_S\\)</span> (total-computable-map predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NatPairing}_S(\\pi)\">\\(\\mathrm{NatPairing}_S(\\pi)\\)</span> (Cantor-pairing predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CharacteristicBit}_S(r,A,n)\">\\(\\mathrm{CharacteristicBit}_S(r,A,n)\\)</span> (characteristic-bit predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoolTableCode}_S(c,m)\">\\(\\mathrm{BoolTableCode}_S(c,m)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoolEval}_S(r,c,v,m)\">\\(\\mathrm{BoolEval}_S(r,c,v,m)\\)</span> (Boolean-table predicates defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2TruthTableReducibility}_S(A,B)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2TruthTableReducibility}_S(A,B)\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion2\\text{-}natural\\text{-}pairing} \\vdash \\mathrm{NatPairing}_S(\\pi)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Function}(\\pi,\\omega\\times\\omega,\\omega)\\land\\forall n,j\\in\\omega\\;\\left(\\pi(\\langle n,j\\rangle)=\\frac{(n+j)(n+j+1)}2+j\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion2\\text{-}natural\\text{-}pairing} \\vdash \\mathrm{NatPairing}_S(\\pi)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Function}(\\pi,\\omega\\times\\omega,\\omega)\\land\\forall n,j\\in\\omega\\;\\left(\\pi(\\langle n,j\\rangle)=\\frac{(n+j)(n+j+1)}2+j\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion2\\text{-}characteristic\\text{-}bit} \\vdash \\mathrm{CharacteristicBit}_S(r,A,n)\\leftrightarrow n\\in\\omega\\land r\\in\\{0,1\\}\\land(r=1\\leftrightarrow n\\in A)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion2\\text{-}characteristic\\text{-}bit} \\vdash \\mathrm{CharacteristicBit}_S(r,A,n)\\leftrightarrow n\\in\\omega\\land r\\in\\{0,1\\}\\land(r=1\\leftrightarrow n\\in A)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion2\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}table\\text{-}code} \\vdash \\mathrm{BoolTableCode}_S(c,m)\\leftrightarrow m\\in\\omega\\land c\\in\\omega\\land c&lt;2^{2^m}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion2\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}table\\text{-}code} \\vdash \\mathrm{BoolTableCode}_S(c,m)\\leftrightarrow m\\in\\omega\\land c\\in\\omega\\land c&lt;2^{2^m}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion2\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}evaluation} \\vdash \\mathrm{BoolEval}_S(r,c,v,m)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{BoolTableCode}_S(c,m)\\land v\\in\\{0,1\\}^m\\land r\\in\\{0,1\\}\\land r=\\left\\lfloor\\frac{c}{2^{\\sum_{j&lt;m}2^jv(j)}}\\right\\rfloor\\bmod 2\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion2\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}evaluation} \\vdash \\mathrm{BoolEval}_S(r,c,v,m)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{BoolTableCode}_S(c,m)\\land v\\in\\{0,1\\}^m\\land r\\in\\{0,1\\}\\land r=\\left\\lfloor\\frac{c}{2^{\\sum_{j&lt;m}2^jv(j)}}\\right\\rfloor\\bmod 2\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion2\\text{-}truth\\text{-}table\\text{-}reducibility} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2TruthTableReducibility}_S(A,B)\\leftrightarrow A\\subseteq\\omega\\land B\\subseteq\\omega\\land\\exists\\pi,k,q,b\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{NatPairing}_S(\\pi)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2TotalComputableMap}_S(k)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2TotalComputableMap}_S(q)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2TotalComputableMap}_S(b)\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists v\\in\\{0,1\\}^{k(n)}\\;\\exists r\\in\\{0,1\\}\\;\\bigl[\\forall j&lt;k(n)\\;\\mathrm{CharacteristicBit}_S(v(j),B,q(\\pi(\\langle n,j\\rangle)))\\land\\mathrm{CharacteristicBit}_S(r,A,n)\\land\\mathrm{BoolEval}_S(r,b(n),v,k(n))\\bigr]\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion2\\text{-}truth\\text{-}table\\text{-}reducibility} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2TruthTableReducibility}_S(A,B)\\leftrightarrow A\\subseteq\\omega\\land B\\subseteq\\omega\\land\\exists\\pi,k,q,b\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{NatPairing}_S(\\pi)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2TotalComputableMap}_S(k)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2TotalComputableMap}_S(q)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2TotalComputableMap}_S(b)\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists v\\in\\{0,1\\}^{k(n)}\\;\\exists r\\in\\{0,1\\}\\;\\bigl[\\forall j&lt;k(n)\\;\\mathrm{CharacteristicBit}_S(v(j),B,q(\\pi(\\langle n,j\\rangle)))\\land\\mathrm{CharacteristicBit}_S(r,A,n)\\land\\mathrm{BoolEval}_S(r,b(n),v,k(n))\\bigr]\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Boolean tables are explicitly encoded by their <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^m\">\\(2^m\\)</span> output bits, and their inputs are finite characteristic-bit vectors. The query map receives a natural Cantor code, so no set-theoretic ordered pair is silently used as a natural-number input.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch06/58-df-zfc-recursion2-total-computable-map.md","status":"resolved","id":"afc30501f405cff5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-zfc-recursion2-total-computable-map.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,B,k,q,b,\\pi,c,m,v,r,n\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2TotalComputableMap}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NatPairing}_S(\\pi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CharacteristicBit}_S(r,A,n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BoolTableCode}_S(c,m)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BoolEval}_S(r,c,v,m)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2TruthTableReducibility}_S(A,B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion2\\text{-}natural\\text{-}pairing} \\vdash \\mathrm{NatPairing}_S(\\pi)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Function}(\\pi,\\omega\\times\\omega,\\omega)\\land\\forall n,j\\in\\omega\\;\\left(\\pi(\\langle n,j\\rangle)=\\frac{(n+j)(n+j+1)}2+j\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion2\\text{-}characteristic\\text{-}bit} \\vdash \\mathrm{CharacteristicBit}_S(r,A,n)\\leftrightarrow n\\in\\omega\\land r\\in\\{0,1\\}\\land(r=1\\leftrightarrow n\\in A)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion2\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}table\\text{-}code} \\vdash \\mathrm{BoolTableCode}_S(c,m)\\leftrightarrow m\\in\\omega\\land c\\in\\omega\\land c<2^{2^m}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion2\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}evaluation} \\vdash \\mathrm{BoolEval}_S(r,c,v,m)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{BoolTableCode}_S(c,m)\\land v\\in\\{0,1\\}^m\\land r\\in\\{0,1\\}\\land r=\\left\\lfloor\\frac{c}{2^{\\sum_{j<m}2^jv(j)}}\\right\\rfloor\\bmod 2","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion2\\text{-}truth\\text{-}table\\text{-}reducibility} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2TruthTableReducibility}_S(A,B)\\leftrightarrow A\\subseteq\\omega\\land B\\subseteq\\omega\\land\\exists\\pi,k,q,b\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{NatPairing}_S(\\pi)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2TotalComputableMap}_S(k)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2TotalComputableMap}_S(q)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2TotalComputableMap}_S(b)\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists v\\in\\{0,1\\}^{k(n)}\\;\\exists r\\in\\{0,1\\}\\;\\bigl[\\forall j<k(n)\\;\\mathrm{CharacteristicBit}_S(v(j),B,q(\\pi(\\langle n,j\\rangle)))\\land\\mathrm{CharacteristicBit}_S(r,A,n)\\land\\mathrm{BoolEval}_S(r,b(n),v,k(n))\\bigr]\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"2^m","display":false}],"bytes":2794,"backlinks":[{"id":"f4bf93120532e75f","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"62eac1885ebe3943","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"a11585cba9c21cfd","anchor":"ref-319","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-recursion2-truth-table-reducibility]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3240","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-recursion2-truth-table-reducibility.md|58-df-zfc-recursion2-truth-table-reducibility]]（batch07）"}],"outgoing":["afc30501f405cff5","36d7463d215be751"]}